  "subject": {
    "id": "contract-compiler-od016-r23-primary",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Bind the single-ledger KnowledgeChangeSet architecture in foundation graph revision 23.",
  "why": "The primary revision binds the operator decision, canonical graph, semantic-history target, compiler runway, strict integration manifest, zero-scope card, retained evidence, public protocol boundaries, and maintainer and inquisitor rules to one exact architecture. It keeps structural-only adoption valid while preventing any structural store or graph API from claiming accepted-state authority."
